  "contract": [
    "Original Spell.dbc 805462 Seismic Wave has heal effect 0 selecting source-area allies and Nature damage",
    "effect 1 selecting source-area enemies. Helpful healing cannot miss a friendly ally because of level",
    "difference. A level 16 caster with ordinary hit chance casts four waves beside a wounded level 80 party",
    "ally. Every cast must heal both the caster and the ally. No hit-rating fixture changes the friendly",
    "hit calculation; hostile damage is observed separately. The caster-heal control proves each cast completed.",
    "A same-level hostile creature checks that the harmful effect still deals damage and does not heal it. A",
    "native Divine Shield fixture then checks that damage immunity remains effective while the higher-level",
    "ally is still healed.",
    "The initial spawn location matches the caster location, so the nearby enemy remains within the wave",
    "radius after the party-positioning steps. The four ordinary hostile hit rolls stay unchanged."
